---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import { blogs } from "../../data/blogsData.js";

const blog = blogs[2];
---

<Layout title={`${blog.title} | Syslatech`} description={blog.description}>
  <main class="bg-white px-5 py-16 font-[Manrope,sans-serif] sm:px-8 lg:px-12">
    <article class="mx-auto max-w-4xl">
      <a href="/Blogs/" class="mb-8 inline-flex text-sm font-semibold text-sky-700 hover:text-sky-900">
        ← Back to All Blogs
      </a>

      <p class="mb-4 text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-sky-700">
        {blog.category}
      </p>

      <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold leading-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl">
        {blog.title}
      </h1>

      <p class="mt-6 text-lg leading-8 text-slate-600">
        {blog.description}
      </p>

      <Image
        src={blog.image}
        alt={blog.alt}
        class="mt-10 w-full rounded-2xl object-cover"
      />

      <div class="prose prose-slate mt-10 max-w-none">
        <p>
          Software quality plays an important role in building reliable digital
          products. As applications become more complex, teams need effective
          testing strategies that help identify issues early and improve
          release confidence.
        </p>
        <h2>Why automation matters</h2>
        <p>
          Automated testing helps teams repeat important checks consistently,
          reduce repetitive manual work, and receive faster feedback during
          development. It works best alongside thoughtful test planning and
          exploratory testing.
        </p>
        <h2>Building a stronger testing strategy</h2>
        <p>
          Start with stable, high-value test cases, maintain them as the
          application changes, and use test results to guide continuous
          improvement. The right approach balances speed, coverage, and
          maintainability.
        </p>
      </div>

      <a href="/Blogs/" class="mt-10 inline-flex rounded-full bg-sky-600 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-bold text-white transition hover:bg-sky-700">
        Explore More Blogs
      </a>
    </article>
  </main>
</Layout>